  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The escape speed from planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{esc}\"></span>. Planet Y has twice the density and half the radius of planet X.</p>\n<p>What is the speed required to escape the gravitational field of planet Y?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{esc}}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{esc}}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{esc}\\sqrt{2}}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{esc}\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
